    Zone to the GY, then target 1 Effect Monster in your opponent's Main Monster
    Zone; place that opponent's monster face-up as a Continuous Spell in their Spell
    & Trap Zone in its same column. (If the zone is occupied, destroy the occupying
    card.)"
